# API Endpoint Conventions

## Structure

Each endpoint in `api/` is a Vercel serverless function exporting `handler(req, res)`.

## Required patterns

- CORS via `setCors(req, res)` on every handler
- Handle `OPTIONS` preflight with 204
- Return JSON via helper: `json(res, status, body)`
- Auth via Bearer token + `supabase.auth.getUser(token)`
- Admin check via `admin_users` table with fallback to `FALLBACK_ADMIN_EMAILS`
- Owner-only operations must check `actor.role === "owner"`

## Environment variables

- Server-side: `SUPABASE_URL`, `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` (NO `VITE_` prefix)
- Frontend: `VITE_SUPABASE_URL`, `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`

## TypeScript

- `tsconfig.node.json` covers `api/` folder with Node types
- `tsconfig.app.json` covers `src/` with DOM types
- Never mix — api/ files must not import from src/
